            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已保存的授权已被撤销。请检查“设置”>“账户”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved network extension configuration is invalid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已保存的网络扩展配置无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved network extension configuration needs to be checked and prepared again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要检查并重新准备已保存的网络扩展配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The secure connection could not start. Review the profile and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全连接无法启动。请检查配置后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The secure connection is ready. New flows will appear here without exposing source addresses or account identifiers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全连接已就绪。新连接会显示在这里，且不会暴露源地址或账户标识。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected file is not a valid AetherRoute portable archive.": {
      "localizations": {
