      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可见范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you connect, traffic and DNS queries may be sent to the proxy and DNS services in the profile you chose. Those providers may observe connection metadata or unencrypted content. Review and trust a profile before importing it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接后，流量和 DNS 查询可能会发送到所选配置中的代理与 DNS 服务。这些服务提供方可能看到连接元数据或未加密内容。导入前请确认配置来源可信。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you connect, traffic and DNS queries may be sent to the proxy and DNS services in the profile you chose. Subscription updates contact the selected provider. If a release configures licensing, AetherRoute refreshes only its signed device receipt with the owner's HTTPS license service after you accept this disclosure. These services may observe your IP address. Review and trust a provider before importing it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接后，流量和 DNS 查询可能会发送到所选配置中的代理与 DNS 服务。订阅更新会联系所选提供方。如果正式版本配置了授权服务，AetherRoute 只会在你接受本说明后，向作者的 HTTPS 授权服务刷新已签名的设备回执。这些服务可能看到你的 IP 地址。导入前请确认服务提供方可信。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "YAML profiles are size-limited, UTF-8 checked, and rejected when they request scripts, plug-ins, commands, or downloadable external UI. The protocol engine performs a second parse before the network extension can report ready.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "YAML 配置会经过大小限制和 UTF-8 检查；包含脚本、插件、命令或可下载外部界面的配置会被拒绝。网络扩展报告就绪前，协议核心还会进行第二次解析。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
