            "value": "订阅既不是受支持的 YAML，也不是节点分享链接列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The subscription provider attempted an unsafe redirect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "订阅提供方尝试了不安全的重定向。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The subscription provider redirected too many times.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "订阅提供方重定向次数过多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The subscription provider returned an invalid response.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "订阅提供方返回了无效响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The subscription provider returned HTTP %lld. Check that the link is active and permitted for this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "订阅提供方返回 HTTP %lld。请检查链接是否有效，以及是否允许这台 Mac 使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The subscription reported no changes before an active profile existed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未建立当前配置时，订阅却报告没有更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The subscription response is too large (%lld bytes).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "订阅响应过大（%lld 字节）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The subscription uses the unsupported ‘%@’ share-link scheme.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "订阅使用了不受支持的“%@”分享链接协议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute binds only 127.0.0.1 and never changes the macOS system proxy. Shell commands affect only the terminal where you paste them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 仅绑定 127.0.0.1，绝不会更改 macOS 系统代理。终端命令只影响粘贴它的终端会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear command copied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清除命令已复制。"
