      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制步骤"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS requires your approval because Transparent Proxy and TUN can route network traffic. AetherRoute cannot approve this security permission for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "透明代理和 TUN 可以路由网络流量，因此 macOS 要求您亲自批准。AetherRoute 无法代替您授予这项系统安全权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next to Network Extensions, click the info button, turn on AetherRoute, then click Done.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找到“网络扩展”，点右侧信息按钮 ⓘ，打开 AetherRoute，然后点“完成”。"
